onNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9418","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"268287","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"57843","synopsis":"Hello, I'm Kanaka Amaya's younger brother, Souta. I apologize for any trouble that my sister may have caused you. Continuing from last time, everyone is over at our house, but it's not like my sister is going to clean her room, so she's doing whatever she wants to. I've received quite a bit of unfair treatment. It was a day that I learned how to entertain guests even though I'm a junior high student. Sigh...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e0fOuqe0JRfw0Ij6lSeqX01ROAI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Hello, I'm Kanaka Amaya's younger brother, Souta. I apologize for any trouble that my sister may have caused you. Continuing from last time, everyone is over at our house, but it's not like my sister is going to clean her room, so she's doing whatever she wants to. I've received quite a bit of unfair treatment. It was a day that I learned how to entertain guests even though I'm a junior high student. Sigh...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e0fOuqe0JRfw0Ij6lSeqX01ROAI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9418","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"268287","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"57844","synopsis":"Hello, I'm Kanaka Amaya. Let's do club activities. Our story finally takes movement in episode 8! And Kanaka's ambition comes to light!! Club activities! Differences of opinion! Confusion and frustration! Comforting each other with passionate friendship! This is our youth!! Well, in the end, nothing really happens. I'm not lying!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n7Svx5Wt8BNxpRG7aRZXsePaDQJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Hello, I'm Kanaka Amaya. Let's do club activities. Our story finally takes movement in episode 8! And Kanaka's ambition comes to light!! Club activities! Differences of opinion! Confusion and frustration! Comforting each other with passionate friendship! This is our youth!! Well, in the end, nothing really happens. I'm not lying!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n7Svx5Wt8BNxpRG7aRZXsePaDQJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9418","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"268287","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"57845","synopsis":"Hello, everyone! It's Misuzu Wakatsuki! I may not look it, but I am a teacher. People always mistake me for a student! Students even ask me out. The principal even calls me cute. In this episode, everyone was talking about their dreams, and I could smell that the youth were troubled with what they should do, so I appeared!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qxTXmRnP3a7qhYzCqhlYifhxlnp.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Hello, everyone! It's Misuzu Wakatsuki! I may not look it, but I am a teacher. People always mistake me for a student! Students even ask me out. The principal even calls me cute. In this episode, everyone was talking about their dreams, and I could smell that the youth were troubled with what they should do, so I appeared!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qxTXmRnP3a7qhYzCqhlYifhxlnp.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9418","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"268287","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"57846","synopsis":"Hello, it's been a while. It's Ayuko Uehara. It's already episode 10. Nothing has changed in our everyday lives. Just like when we first started school, Kanakana covered my eyes, but I'm not who I used to be a few months ago! I feel like I've almost gotten to the level of Saki-chan, who can dodge Kanakana. Then again, not many people play \"guess who?\" at our age... We tried to be like the rest of the female students in the world and talk about love, but apparently that was beyond our level...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/131leWA20OBVuDK5uL4nCQzFzKT.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Hello, it's been a while. It's Ayuko Uehara. It's already episode 10. Nothing has changed in our everyday lives. Just like when we first started school, Kanakana covered my eyes, but I'm not who I used to be a few months ago! I feel like I've almost gotten to the level of Saki-chan, who can dodge Kanakana. Then again, not many people play \"guess who?\" at our age... We tried to be like the rest of the female students in the world and talk about love, but apparently that was beyond our level...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/131leWA20OBVuDK5uL4nCQzFzKT.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9418","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17082","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"268287","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"57847","synopsis":"Um... Jinguji Hika...ri? Hikaru...? Whatever. My name is actually Sumiko Yamashita and I'm the teacher of the 1st Year, Class 3. It's raining today so I don't feel like doing anything. I could really care less that Kanaka is wearing rain boots and Saki isn't wearing any shoes at all. Why is it even raining? It's not like anyone wants to leave their house when it's raining, so everything should just be closed. Then again, it would suck if the convinience stores were closed, too. Then... Stop talking about this nonsense and go home already. And that ends the first semester!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gotvEatjCkCmBVq7zBXPUfmsHhS.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Um... Jinguji Hika...ri? Hikaru...? Whatever. My name is actually Sumiko Yamashita and I'm the teacher of the 1st Year, Class 3. It's raining today so I don't feel like doing anything. I could really care less that Kanaka is wearing rain boots and Saki isn't wearing any shoes at all. Why is it even raining? It's not like anyone wants to leave their house when it's raining, so everything should just be closed. Then again, it would suck if the convinience stores were closed, too. Then... Stop talking about this nonsense and go home already. And that ends the first semester!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gotvEatjCkCmBVq7zBXPUfmsHhS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","syno